(: One XPath 3.1 map per share class with ISIN, name and published NAV price
   (XPath 3.1: map constructor, simple map operator !). :)
/FundsXML4/Funds/Fund/SingleFund/ShareClasses/ShareClass
    ! map { 'isin'     : string(Identifiers/ISIN),
            'name'     : string(Names/OfficialName),
            'navPrice' : number(Prices/Price/NavPrice) }
